    {
      "id": "u_ccdcdc19e07204072271dc65_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "In the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note Tree__TRILIUM_PH_1__: ",
      "sourceHash": "ccdcdc19e07204072271dc6570b2641544647e65fde76a3fe100f17454fd3c3a",
      "context": "Text Snippets > Creating a text snippet",
      "contextHash": "343011f5a1669ecf5990c271fc1539b3dbbcc043e219fc722d76fa936c4840d3",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c36132af01744bb91d012e65_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Right click a note where to place the text snippet.",
      "sourceHash": "c36132af01744bb91d012e655ce2a0209127e0a46af97743353bec565ede20e8",
      "context": "Text Snippets > Creating a text snippet",
      "contextHash": "343011f5a1669ecf5990c271fc1539b3dbbcc043e219fc722d76fa936c4840d3",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1d0208f9b36caa96f0c967b5_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Select __TRILIUM_PH_0__Insert child note__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "1d0208f9b36caa96f0c967b5e363eb933219746379cdb4eee8b99cfc1ebb37f0",
      "context": "Text Snippets > Creating a text snippet",
      "contextHash": "343011f5a1669ecf5990c271fc1539b3dbbcc043e219fc722d76fa936c4840d3",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_06c7c5f29f66f5fcaf6622e8_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Select __TRILIUM_PH_0__More__TRILIUM_PH_1__ → __TRILIUM_PH_2__Text snippet__TRILIUM_PH_3__.",
      "sourceHash": "06c7c5f29f66f5fcaf6622e8b065019185bcead62262469a49213c875a31a37b",
      "context": "Text Snippets > Creating a text snippet",
      "contextHash": "343011f5a1669ecf5990c271fc1539b3dbbcc043e219fc722d76fa936c4840d3",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_fe772fd26717ce79661c2fac_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Afterwards, simply type in the content of the note the desired text. The text can be formatted in the same manner as a normal text note.",
      "sourceHash": "fe772fd26717ce79661c2facb68e93a701bc018e6cdc2cfffacf2bf86bbe3cdc",
      "context": "Text Snippets > Creating a text snippet",
      "contextHash": "343011f5a1669ecf5990c271fc1539b3dbbcc043e219fc722d76fa936c4840d3",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8bc86d8a7ecedb34644a0291_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The title of the note will become the title of the template. Optionally, a description can be added in the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Promoted Attributes__TRILIUM_PH_1__ section.",
      "sourceHash": "8bc86d8a7ecedb34644a0291d7b4f45e9876c37cf5fce23c9e4628df9b7e830b",
      "context": "Text Snippets > Creating a text snippet",
      "contextHash": "343011f5a1669ecf5990c271fc1539b3dbbcc043e219fc722d76fa936c4840d3",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_073e8c8f3509d4a40ea8b322_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Inserting a snippet__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
