      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_157d614819d0b766f0da2e30_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Once a snippet is created, there are two options to insert it:",
      "sourceHash": "157d614819d0b766f0da2e305eb0f6223feb5522653257408c35971ca0e16d60",
      "context": "Text Snippets > Inserting a snippet",
      "contextHash": "6d9e738447d2c6c627b0deccbd78d92c5a3630419e018f4c4e74907c300a16d0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1ed4add06a20aca589bd1745_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "From the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Formatting toolbar__TRILIUM_PH_1__, by looking for the __TRILIUM_PH_2__ button.",
      "sourceHash": "1ed4add06a20aca589bd17452ef1eded41198c82665e2b336e8810ed14abf00e",
      "context": "Text Snippets > Inserting a snippet",
      "contextHash": "6d9e738447d2c6c627b0deccbd78d92c5a3630419e018f4c4e74907c300a16d0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a198259ed704b365dc3ce9cd_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Using __TRILIUM_PH_0__Slash Commands__TRILIUM_PH_1__: ",
      "sourceHash": "a198259ed704b365dc3ce9cdd961eac2211f2b9ea7d4423c616b32ff4ccefb07",
      "context": "Text Snippets > Inserting a snippet",
      "contextHash": "6d9e738447d2c6c627b0deccbd78d92c5a3630419e018f4c4e74907c300a16d0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4642e1ecf70bbe529467b2c2_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To look for a specific template, start typing the name of the template (its title).",
      "sourceHash": "4642e1ecf70bbe529467b2c29f8dc6cf6beb2cf0202e4255b3abf5de94788fca",
      "context": "Text Snippets > Inserting a snippet",
      "contextHash": "6d9e738447d2c6c627b0deccbd78d92c5a3630419e018f4c4e74907c300a16d0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2065b962bc3b8174b1ac67d9_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To look for all the templates, type __TRILIUM_PH_0__.",
      "sourceHash": "2065b962bc3b8174b1ac67d98425eb001c1399b3247b1d082cf1c9d94a35c8ba",
      "context": "Text Snippets > Inserting a snippet",
      "contextHash": "6d9e738447d2c6c627b0deccbd78d92c5a3630419e018f4c4e74907c300a16d0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f3c96b2d537b39faeac1900e_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "A newly created snippet doesn't appear? Generally it takes up to a few seconds to refresh the list of templates once you make a change.",
      "sourceHash": "f3c96b2d537b39faeac1900e93f8cf3fcdcf9647d38c3b143387f48a1f22d606",
      "context": "Text Snippets > Inserting a snippet",
      "contextHash": "6d9e738447d2c6c627b0deccbd78d92c5a3630419e018f4c4e74907c300a16d0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_600a83ac88f4eb016b00ea50_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "If this doesn't happen, __TRILIUM_PH_0__reload the application__TRILIUM_PH_1__ and __TRILIUM_PH_2__report the issue__TRILIUM_PH_3__to us. ",
      "sourceHash": "600a83ac88f4eb016b00ea50b0ae6448618c815ad6c07a2a80f04ede7d590c0a",
      "context": "Text Snippets > Inserting a snippet",
      "contextHash": "6d9e738447d2c6c627b0deccbd78d92c5a3630419e018f4c4e74907c300a16d0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2d166eed4e46d147ae179d3f_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Limitations__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "2d166eed4e46d147ae179d3feba2dbd0d28887b22a99884dc255c7ff2e43988d",
